  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.0.0: lockstep republish against the core 10.0.0. Adopts the core's new shapes: CosmosSink stays an IScraperSink wired via .WriteToCosmosDb (ADR-0038's two-seam surface unchanged for sinks); MIT relicense (ADR-0017). Requires WebReaper 10.0.0. 9.0.0: lockstep republish against the core 9.0.0 (ADR-0023: the core public surface is now the documented contract; Tier-2 implementation types internalised). No functional change. 8.0.0: lockstep republish against the core 8.0.0 major (ADR-0022); no functional change. 7.0.0: initial release. Azure Cosmos DB sink (ScraperEngineBuilder.WriteToCosmosDb) extracted from the WebReaper core per ADR-0009 so the core stays dependency-light and Native-AOT-clean (core no longer references Microsoft.Azure.Cosmos).",
